OL,3,GNEWSASurvey to offer 'vital insight'
OL,4,Ainto lives of children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survey for young people on topics
OL,7,Fincluding health, wellbeing, school
OL,8,Flife and social media is set to open in
OL,9,FOctober.
OL,11,FStatistics Jersey said the survey would
OL,12,Fbe offered to students from year four
OL,13,Fto year 12 and would run from 5 to 16
OL,14,FOctober. It said the 2026 Children and
OL,15,FYoung People's Survey was voluntary,
OL,16,Fanonymous and could be completed
OL,17,Fonline.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
