OL,3,GNEWSASurvey to offer 'vital insight'
OL,4,Ainto lives of children
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials said it would be the first
OL,7,Ftime the survey would ask participants
OL,8,Fabout social media apps and generative
OL,9,FAI tools, including how often they use
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FIan Cope, chief statistician, said it
OL,13,Fprovided a "vital insight" into the
OL,14,Flives of children and young people on
OL,15,Fthe island.
